# Working notes, kept locally and out of the public repo.
#
# These are written for the author, not for a reader of this repository: the
# narration script and shot list for the pitch video, the session handoff, and
# the plan and spec documents the build was executed against. The engineering
# documentation a visitor actually wants stays tracked: README.md,
# docs/ARCHITECTURE.md, docs/FINDINGS.md, docs/site-copy.md and docs/gates/.
docs/VIDEO-SCRIPT.md
docs/SESSION-HANDOFF.md
docs/superpowers/

# Agent and editor working directories. Never were tracked; named here so they
